WinUtil — .NET 10 rewrite (unofficial)
======================================

This project is an unofficial rewrite of Chris Titus Tech's WinUtil from
PowerShell into a .NET 10 / C# (WPF) application. It is NOT affiliated with,
endorsed by, or maintained by Chris Titus Tech or CT Tech Group LLC.

