  (see LICENSE).

Material derived from the original project
------------------------------------------
The following are copied or adapted from ChrisTitusTech/winutil and remain
under its MIT License:

  - Configuration data — config/*.json and dotnet/config/*.json
    (the application catalog and the tweak / appx / feature / dns / preset /
    theme definitions).
  - tools/autounattend.xml and its embedded copy used by the ISO builder.
  - The overall feature set, tweak semantics, and UI layout, which this
    project reimplements in C#.

